# Python
__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
*.egg-info/
.venv/
build/
dist/

# Local scratch under data/ (the sqlite DB + HF parquet cache) is ignored.
# Root-anchored so web/data/ is not caught.
/data/*
hf_cache/
*.db
*.db-wal
*.db-shm

# Deliverables tracked despite the data ignore — every eval run's full
# per-case fidelity + reports/ must stay publicly visible in git, not just
# the reports/experiment_log.jsonl rollup line:
# - reports/ (entire tree — do not gitignore)
# - data/manifests/subset-draws/ = canonical comparison subset draws (#20)
# - data/experiments/<run_id>/ = cases.jsonl, summary.json,
#   prompts_snapshot.json, subset_manifest.json{l,}, scoring_suite.json —
#   the full-fidelity record the experiment-log skill's storage layout
#   promises alongside the tracked reports/ rollup (no raw doc text: cases
#   carry doc_text_sha256, not the corpus text itself).
!/data/manifests/
!/data/manifests/subset-draws/
!/data/experiments/

# The Vercel viewer snapshot IS tracked (generated by scripts/export_site_snapshot.py)
!web/data/snapshot.json

# Local pipeline checkout (uv path source; clone per README — never commit)
Digital-Mailroom/

# Env & secrets
.env
*.key

# OS / editor
.DS_Store
.idea/
.vscode/
docs/.Rhistory
/.cursor/agents
